      "landing.awarenessTitle": "[Lietuvių] Why Carbon Footprint Monitoring Matters",
      "landing.awarenessDesc1": "[Lietuvių] Human activities generate greenhouse gases that accelerate global climate change. Every commute, electricity bill, dietary choice, and retail purchase carries a hidden carbon cost.",
      "landing.awarenessDesc2": "[Lietuvių] By establishing a clear baseline and measuring daily outputs, individuals and organizations can target impactful reductions, unlock financial savings, and drive meaningful environmental stewardship.",
